# Patches from patches/kernel/ that are not applied, because the Ubuntu
# Asahi 7.0.12 base (Ubuntu-7.0.0-28.28) does not contain the code they
# change. One file name per line; lines starting with # are comments.

# Fixes 14b007e17881, which is not in 7.0.12.
0059-block-Fix-start-and-length-check-added-to-iov_iter_e.patch

# x86 only (Intel IOMMU, x86 PAT), not built for arm64.
0086-iommu-vt-d-Flush-context-cache-with-correct-SID-when.patch
0124-x86-mm-pat-Acquire-init_mm-write-lock-on-collapse-to.patch

# Fix an x86 CMOS RTC regression that came with Ubuntu-7.0.0-39.39.
0200-ACPI-x86-rtc-cmos-Use-platform-device-for-driver-bin.patch
0201-rtc-cmos-Use-platform_get_irq_optional-in-cmos_platf.patch

# Revert Ubuntu's r8169 phylink series, which 7.0.12 does not carry.
0202-Revert-UBUNTU-SAUCE-r8169-fix-RTL8116af-can-not-ente.patch
0203-Revert-UBUNTU-SAUCE-r8169-add-ltr-support-for-RTL811.patch
0204-Revert-UBUNTU-SAUCE-r8169-add-support-for-RTL8127atf.patch
0205-Revert-UBUNTU-SAUCE-r8169-add-support-for-RTL8116af.patch
0206-Revert-UBUNTU-SAUCE-r8169-add-support-for-phylink.patch
0207-Revert-UBUNTU-SAUCE-net-phy-phylink-add-helper-to-mo.patch
0208-Revert-UBUNTU-SAUCE-r8169-add-speed-in-private-struc.patch
0209-Reapply-UBUNTU-SAUCE-r8169-add-quirk-for-RTL8116af-S.patch
